load @term/seed/structure/space/vector
  find vector-space

# A simplex: the simplest polytope in each dimension, the convex hull of one more point than the dimension, a point, a
# segment, a triangle, a tetrahedron, and on. Simplices are the building blocks of triangulated spaces and the cells of
# simplicial complexes, the combinatorial bones of topology. The form carries the vector space the simplex spans.
form simplex
  link space, like vector-space
